    },
    "message": "Move a facility's queue rules to Rust kernels\n\nprepare_facility_queue, progress_physical_queue_positions and _head_to_service,\nphysical_service_capacity and shared_passage_edge_loads plan and then write in one\ncall each. A person who gives up on the queue and an independent FIFO go to the Python\nrules before anything is written. The movement kernels' route to a facility and\nstart of a journey are now plans the queue kernels share.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
