    "message": "Leave a queue's capacity and the passages' loads to the Python rules\n\nMeasured beside the Python rule on the budget's fork: the kernel of shared_passage_edge_loads\ncost 13 -> 100 us a tick, since it reads a row from each event Python scheduled, and that\nof physical_service_capacity gained under 1 us.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
